      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『打败迷人景致、\n现役最强的新老交替来开序幕……！』\n这么写的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5ed750d75991a54acc56d1fed8d937edd14096ebef4446fb1b26b987cf3e59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
