      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呜嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷……！\n黄金巨匠～～～～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94c43ec2304f99d57199be7e9788531b0445cbcd93e78f1e72913291b5bcfea9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
