      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――呼声震耳欲聋。那毫无疑问、\n是对即将肩负未来的……\n新时代之王的热切期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cfd38110a42c5dd648a99e0558ac81467fb95d448a5f98425a862b5123e80d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
