    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21173f83b03c79c7392ff689",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然还是瞄准的最后一冠『秋华赏』是吗？\n换言之――不考虑『凯旋门赏』了吗？\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "45e43f0621d754c9ecb27e6576d9cac7720c9626d674b8cf97799aadc1ee6c71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
