      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确、这些声音我也听到了。\n在后冠赛马娘于全球活跃的当下、\n迷人景致自然备受各种期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "501d4bbbdb9e774c6642d3be95a4d8fb1b4df43d84ac00637c88347c68cfb69b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
