    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ef9a4f4eaf95a4239dd6ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若能实现日本比赛界的悲愿――\n称霸『凯旋门赏』的话、\n那定会是无比壮丽的景色吧。不过――",
      "source_fingerprint": "443a08f08018ffd182bd096d86ee5f251d5d0fa07a8ef6b15268b162ec88bcaf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
