      "uid": "zhcn:ebcc32ab241457ea8a2a294d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致会坚持走完三后冠路线。\n这是打一开始就定下的目标。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "25493b6fdc66959bfd6e25317521380fa5fbbd8c123e5c14bcf04185f8bda258",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1114/storytimeline_501114300.json",
      "json_path": [
